&lt;li&gt;Lead test campaigns including test plan creation, system activation, test operations, data review, and equipment design/fabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate work instructions to direct and instruct technicians in the fabrication and integration of test articles and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and troubleshoot data acquisition and control systems, wiring, and instrumentation, as well as thermal chambers, electrodynamics shakers, and fluid power systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate repetitive test operations to improve efficiency and safety&lt;/li&gt;
