&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Workplace Experience &amp;amp; Facilities Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Employee Experience and Facilities team at the Bangalore Hub on an onsite basis.&lt;/p&gt;
