&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Benefits may include medical, dental, and life insurance; paid time off; weekly pay and direct deposit; scholarship opportunities; one-on-one training; recognition programs; referral bonuses; 401(k) with company match; and opportunities for career advancement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
