&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;Now Hiring: STAT Critical Care Nurse (RN) - Westchester County/ Bronx/Rockland County/Orange County&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
