&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;What You&#39;ll Earn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$45-$50/hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefits (PTO, 401k, medical/dental/vision)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;What You&#39;ll Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&amp;nbsp; (minimum $36/hr week)&lt;/li&gt;
